  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Cut lemon slices in half and tear mint leaves into thirds. Crush lemon, mint, and sugar together in a cup until sugar is completely wet. Pour cold brew on top. Mix well until sugar is dissolved. Add ice cubes and top with soda water. Stir well.",
